  "Quitar": "Remove",
  "Tu historial laboral": "Your work history",
  "Del periodo más antiguo al más reciente: el último es tu trabajo actual. Puedes usar decimales (0,5 años = 6 meses). Cada periodo se calcula con las cifras de 2026, sin actualizar los sueldos con la inflación.": "From the oldest period to the most recent: the last one is your current job. You can use decimals (0.5 years = 6 months). Each period is calculated with 2026 figures, without adjusting pay for inflation.",
  "Todavía no hay ningún periodo: añade uno o rellena el ejemplo.": "There are no periods yet: add one or fill in the example.",
  "+ Trabajo": "+ Job",
  "+ Autónomo": "+ Self-employed",
  "+ Paro": "+ Unemployment",
  "Rellenar con un ejemplo": "Fill in an example",
  "Vaciar": "Clear",
  "Ejemplo: {a} durante 5 años, {b} durante 3, 1 año de paro y {c} durante 3. Lo que cobras de paro cuenta como usado del sistema y las cotizaciones que lo generaron ya no valen para el siguiente.": "Example: {a} for 5 years, {b} for 3, 1 year of unemployment and {c} for 3. What you receive in unemployment benefit counts as used from the system, and the contributions that generated it no longer count towards the next one.",
  "Sin derecho: no llegas a 360 días cotizados (o 12 meses seguidos de autónomo).": "No entitlement: you do not reach 360 contribution days (or 12 consecutive months as self-employed).",
  "Declaras {a} meses, pero sólo {b} daban derecho.": "You declare {a} months, but only {b} gave entitlement.",
  "Te correspondían {n} meses a {x} al mes.": "You were entitled to {n} months at {x} a month.",
  "Tu historial, periodo a periodo": "Your history, period by period",
  "Lo aportado, lo cotizado para el paro y lo cobrado de paro en cada periodo": "What was contributed, what was paid in for unemployment benefit and what was received in each period",
  "Periodo": "Period",
