  "Sueldo o ingresos": "Pay or income",
  "Aportado": "Contributed",
  "Cotizado para el paro": "Paid in for unemployment benefit",
  "Paro cobrado": "Benefit received",
  "Para ver el balance hacen falta tu sueldo o tus ingresos (apartado 1) y tu edad (apartado 2).": "To see the balance we need your pay or income (section 1) and your age (section 2).",
  "Tu cuota de autónomo": "Your self-employed contribution",
