  "Con menos de 12 meses seguidos cotizados por cese de actividad no se cobra esta prestación.": "With fewer than 12 consecutive months contributed for cessation of activity, this benefit is not paid.",
  "Con menos de {n} días cotizados no hay prestación contributiva (podría haber algún subsidio, que no calculamos).": "With fewer than {n} days contributed there is no contributory benefit (there might be some subsidy, which we do not calculate).",
  "cese de actividad": "cessation-of-activity benefit",
  "paro": "unemployment benefit",
  "Para calcular el paro hace falta al menos un periodo de trabajo: indica tus años trabajando en el apartado 3.": "To calculate unemployment benefit we need at least one period of work: enter your years working in section 3.",
  "de cese de actividad has generado para el Estado": "of cessation-of-activity benefit you have generated for the State",
  "de paro has generado para el Estado": "of unemployment benefit you have generated for the State",
