  "Nada: no hay años de trabajo.": "Nothing: there are no years of work.",
  "de cese de actividad ya has cobrado": "of cessation-of-activity benefit you have already received",
  "de paro ya has cobrado": "of unemployment benefit you have already received",
  "El {x} de lo que has generado": "{x} of what you have generated",
  "Tu último periodo es de paro, así que ya estás cobrándolo (o lo has agotado). Para ver qué te tocaría después, añade un nuevo trabajo al final de tu historial en el apartado 3.": "Your last period is unemployment, so you are already receiving it (or have used it up). To see what you would be entitled to afterwards, add a new job at the end of your history in section 3.",
  "de cese de actividad te tocarían si lo dejaras hoy": "of cessation-of-activity benefit you would get if you stopped today",
