  "Comparamos el paro que has generado para el sistema con el que cobrarías si dejaras de trabajar hoy, calculado con tu último trabajo.": "We compare the unemployment benefit you have generated for the system with what you would receive if you stopped working today, calculated with your last job.",
  "Qué suponemos en el cálculo del paro": "What we assume in the unemployment benefit calculation",
  "1 · Tu sueldo": "1 · Your pay",
